{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-sleep#card-zh","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-sleep","commit":"2c14c0d79cb60d7993698f76cd7c41e5968c304c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sleep 是一个供 DSH 使用的计时等待插件，在 host 侧注册 sleep 工具，让模型按毫秒数暂停执行。工具支持设置单次等待上限和缺省时长，负数会归零，超限会钳制；调用结果包含请求时长、实际时长、取消与钳制状态，也可回显等待理由。等待期间响应执行信号取消，并将取消作为正常结果返回。适合需要等待服务重启、debounce 窗口或 retry backoff 的 DSH 工作流。通过 profile 插件命令安装，使用前可配置最大时长和缺省时长。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:22-46","src/tools.ts:109-184","cordis.patch.yml:5-10"]}
{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-sleep#card-en","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-sleep","commit":"2c14c0d79cb60d7993698f76cd7c41e5968c304c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sleep adds a sleep tool to DSH. Models can wait for a chosen duration; configurable limits clamp long requests. The tool responds to cancellation and reports elapsed time and status. Useful for restart waits, debounce windows, and retry backoff.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:22-46","src/tools.ts:109-184","cordis.patch.yml:5-10"]}
