{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-sleep#feature-1","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-sleep","commit":"2c14c0d79cb60d7993698f76cd7c41e5968c304c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sleep 的功能「按时长暂停」：工具接收毫秒时长并等待后返回实际耗时；可选 reason 会随结果回显。 由模型调用 sleep 工具触发，输入毫秒时长与可选理由，输出等待状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:122-135","src/tools.ts:168-183"]}
{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-sleep#feature-2","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-sleep","commit":"2c14c0d79cb60d7993698f76cd7c41e5968c304c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sleep 的功能「限制等待时长」：插件配置最大等待时长，超限请求会被钳制，并在结果中标明钳制状态。 由模型调用 sleep 工具触发，输入毫秒时长与可选理由，输出等待状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:25-41","src/tools.ts:45-55"]}
{"unit_id":"HuanLinOTO__dsh-plugin-sleep#feature-3","repo":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-sleep","commit":"2c14c0d79cb60d7993698f76cd7c41e5968c304c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sleep 的功能「响应取消信号」：等待过程监听执行信号；收到取消后清理定时器并返回 cancelled 状态，不把取消当异常抛出。 由模型调用 sleep 工具触发，输入毫秒时长与可选理由，输出等待状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:66-93","src/tools.ts:168-180"]}
